          %p
            Or rather, the Toda bracket is usually and equivalently taken to be the
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/homotopy+class"} homotopy class
            of the
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/1-morphism"} 1-morphism
